{"id":"n30204-1-19","stage":1,"title":"식다 · 凉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30204-1-19-1","ko":"국이 식기 전에 빨리 와서 드세요.","zh":"趁汤还没凉，快来喝。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"국이","meaning":"汤","explanation":"국：汤；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"국","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36778","senseId":"1","lemma":"국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국이","audio":"/audio/24fc2becef7a044e10e1.mp3"}},{"text":"식기","meaning":"凉","explanation":"식다：凉；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"식다","audio":"/audio/6ae572e959621a79ba3c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30204","senseId":"1","lemma":"식다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식기","audio":"/audio/426b8201bb0f41219755.mp3"}},{"text":"전에","meaning":"上","explanation":"전：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17306","senseId":"2","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에","audio":"/audio/2d406c50ea3b8c668815.mp3"}},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快。","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}},{"text":"와서","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와서","audio":"/audio/fff1948ffcab0f48d739.mp3"}},{"text":"드세요.","meaning":"用餐、吃或喝（敬语）","explanation":"들다：用餐、吃或喝（敬语）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57293","senseId":"3","lemma":"들다","origin":"